 "remarks": "Location, lifestyle and value! This Glenbrook gem checks all the boxes! Whether you're searching for your next home or a smart addition to your investment portfolio, this inviting 2-bedroom, 1-fully updated bath condo offers an exceptional opportunity in one of Stamford's most convenient locations. Step inside this freshly painted home to discover beautiful hardwood floors (75% must be covered) throughout the living room and dining area, a stylish kitchen featuring granite countertops and stainless steel appliances, and your own private deck, perfect for savoring your morning coffee or unwinding after a long day. Love the outdoors? You're within walking distance of spectacular Cove Island Park, where scenic walking and biking paths, sandy beaches, a skating rink, and endless recreational opportunities await. When it's time to head out, you're just minutes from I-95, shopping, Stamford's vibrant restaurant scene, theaters, and entertainment. Add in low common charges, assigned parking and private storage and the appeal becomes even greater. Move right in and enjoy the lifestyle, or capitalize on a fantastic investment opportunity. Either way, this is one you won't want to miss. click on movie icon for virtual tour",
